+        "message": "The problem is infeasible. (HiGHS Status 8: model_status is Infeasible; primal_status is None)"
+      },
+      "lp_verdict_at_wider_bounds": {
+        "10": "infeasible",
+        "100": "infeasible",
+        "10000": "infeasible"
+      },
+      "exact_infeasibility_witness": {
+        "both_directions_present_on_every_triple": true,
+        "missing_move_rows": [],
+        "argument": [
+          "row(i,i+1,i+2): w[i+2] - w[i] - w[i+1] <= 0",
+          "row(i+2,i+1,i): w[i] - w[i+2] - w[i+1] <= 0",
+          "their sum is -2*w[i+1] <= 0, so w[1..n-2] >= 0 for every 0<=i<=n-3",
+          "row(n-1,n-2,n-3) gives w[n-3] <= w[n-2] + w[n-1]; w[n-3] >= 0 by the line above (n-3 lies in [1,n-2] for n>=4), so w[n-2] + w[n-1] >= 0",
+          "hence sum_{i=2..n-1} w[i] = sum_{i=2..n-3} w[i] + (w[n-2]+w[n-1]) >= 0",
+          "the goal row demands potential(goal) - potential(initial) >= margin, i.e. w[1] - sum_{i=1..n-1} w[i] >= margin, i.e. sum_{i=2..n-1} w[i] <= -margin < 0 -- contradiction, for every margin > 0 and with no reference to the +/-bound box"
+        ]
+      }
+    }
+  ],
+  "positive_controls": {
+    "why": "so that 'infeasible' on every rung is a result about the family and not a broken solver or a broken harness.",
+    "cases": [
+      {
+        "n": 4,
